    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 395,000\n\nBuilt in 2022, this A rated home comes to the market in pristine condition throughout.\nThe current owners have spared no expense on flooring, light fittings and appliances as well as storage, with lots of extra storage in the living room and wardrobes in three of the bedrooms.\nIn terms of location, Wexford Golf Club is under 1km, Tesco is under 2km and Wexford's South Main Street is approximately 2.5km so you can benefit from all local and town amenities.\nIf you are looking for all the pluses of a newly built home but one that is turn-key and ready to go, No. 35 might just fit the bill.\nOff-street parking, west facing rear garden, 117 sqm with 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and guest WC downstairs."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.3m x 2m\ntiled flooring, understair storage\n\nLiving Room - 5.7m x 4m\nwith laminate flooring, electric fire in feature wall, lots of extra storage and shelving. Glazed double doors to.....\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.4m x 4.4m\nwith tiled floor, waist and eye level units (appliances included), patio doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.7m x 1.6m\nwith tiled floor, plumbed (appliances included), built in units, glazed rear door\n\nGuest WC - 1.6m x 1.5m\nwith tiled floor and part tiled walls, WC and WHB\n\nLanding - 3.4m x 1m and 2m x 1m\ncarpeted, attic hatch\n\nBedroom 1 - 36.1m x 2.7m\nfront-facing room with carpet and storage area, single bed (included in the sale)\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.7m x 3.3m\nwith carpet and large built-in wardrobe\n\nEnsuite - 2.5m x 1.2m\nwith tiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB in vanity unit and mains shower\n\nBathroom - 2.6m x 1.8m\nwith tield floor and part tiled walls, WC, WHB in vanity unit, bath and mains shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.4m x 3.2m\nrear-facing room with carpet flooring and triple wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.2m x 2.6m\nrear-facing room with carpet and double wardrobe, bunk beds (inluded in the sale)\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>117 sqm semi-detached home</li><li>Built 2022</li><li>Finished to a very high standard throughout</li><li>Living room with lots of storage</li><li>Kitchen/dining area with access to west facing garden</li><li>Four bedrooms, main with ensuite</li><li>Air to water heating</li><li>Safe enclosed west facing rear garden, terraced with patio area and grassed area</ul>"
      },
